---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalHeader from '../../components/LegalHeader.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { withSiteNameEn } from '../../data/site';

const title = withSiteNameEn('Cookie Settings');
const description = 'Manage cookies and analytics preferences in the Raghadan Forest guide.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="en">
  <LegalHeader />
  <main id="main-content" class="section-space">
    <article class="container-site max-w-4xl">
      <span class="eyebrow">Manage preferences</span>
      <h1 class="section-title">Cookie settings</h1>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--forest-700)]">Last updated: 30 October 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-10 rounded-[2rem] border border-[var(--line)] bg-white/75 p-6 shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(17,37,29,.05)] sm:p-9 lg:p-12">
        <p class="text-[var(--muted)]">We use the minimum storage techniques to operate your choices. You can change preferences below at any time. This site does not currently use personalized advertising technology.</p>

        <form id="cookie-form" class="mt-10 space-y-4">
          <section class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[var(--line)] p-5 sm:p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-black">Essential storage</h2>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">Necessary to save your privacy decision and basic preferences. It cannot be disabled from this page because it saves the disable choice itself.</p>
              </div>
              <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[var(--mist-100)] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black text-[var(--forest-700)]">Always active</span>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[var(--line)] p-5 sm:p-6">
            <label class="flex cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-6">
              <span>
                <span class="block text-lg font-black">Analytics cookies</span>
                <span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">When enabled, we load Google Analytics to understand general visit patterns and improve content. It stays disabled until you give consent.</span>
              </span>
              <input id="analytics" name="analytics" type="checkbox" class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 accent-[var(--forest-700)]" />
            </label>
          </section>


          <section class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--mist-50)] p-5 opacity-75 sm:p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-black">Marketing and advertising cookies</h2>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">The project does not currently use personalized ads or marketing cookies, so this type stays disabled.</p>
              </div>
              <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-black text-[var(--muted)]">Not used</span>
            </div>
          </section>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-4">
            <button type="submit" class="rounded-full bg-[var(--forest-900)] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white">Save preferences</button>
            <button id="reject" type="button" class="rounded-full border border-[var(--line)] bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-black text-[var(--forest-900)]">Reject non-essential</button>
          </div>
          <p id="status" class="min-h-6 text-sm font-bold text-[var(--forest-700)]" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>

        <div class="prose-ar mt-12 border-t border-[var(--line)] pt-8">
          <h2>How does the choice work?</h2>
          <p>Your decision is stored locally in your browser under a site-specific preferences key. Turning analytics off disables this measurement ID in the current tab and future visits when the choice can be stored. Previously sent data cannot be recalled. A loaded Google library may remain in memory. Storage failures are explained below the buttons. You can also clear the site data from your browser settings to remove the saved preference.</p>
          <h2>Third-party content</h2>
          <p>The Google Maps embed may contact Google when loaded. Weather is requested through this site from Open-Meteo; no visitor geolocation is requested. Cloudflare delivery logs and any hosting performance beacon operate separately from this Google Analytics switch. The switch does not control those services. See the <a href="/en/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for clearer details.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />

</BaseLayout>
